{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Boba Teashop</strong> is a cozy horror game where you own and manage a boba tea shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare boba teas, serve customers, and expand your menu to attract more patrons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/6c59aac69b7e37e9a2d03f9951c2f697.webp?t=1758094031\" width=600 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/4615eb958d8b4b4c46634730fc3178db.poster.avif?t=1758094031\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/4615eb958d8b4b4c46634730fc3178db.webm?t=1758094031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/4615eb958d8b4b4c46634730fc3178db.mp4?t=1758094031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Risa, a woman in her 30s who is tired of corporate life and has decided to chase her dream of opening a boba tea shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/3f685c11d3eddb2a0e8dc64bcdf16c3b.webp?t=1758094031\" width=600 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/eadb667dc9800e443351e12f717d40d0.poster.avif?t=1758094031\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/eadb667dc9800e443351e12f717d40d0.webm?t=1758094031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/eadb667dc9800e443351e12f717d40d0.mp4?t=1758094031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a boba tea shop owner, you will encounter a variety of customers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to greet them with a smile and take their orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/682abfa4b58a538318ce9c479acd2107.webp?t=1758094031\" width=600 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/0980534b3249f455a025db49a50d5400.poster.avif?t=1758094031\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/0980534b3249f455a025db49a50d5400.webm?t=1758094031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/0980534b3249f455a025db49a50d5400.mp4?t=1758094031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making boba tea is simple.\u00a0The ingredients are just milk tea and boba.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seal the cup with a lid and serve it with a straw for sipping and enjoying the boba pearls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/69e7b219a726ab7af3fa0528aafcc7c3.poster.avif?t=1758094031\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/69e7b219a726ab7af3fa0528aafcc7c3.webm?t=1758094031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/69e7b219a726ab7af3fa0528aafcc7c3.mp4?t=1758094031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But sometimes, you'll encounter demanding customers with special requests or those who leave a mess in your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the proud owner of a boba tea shop, there's nothing you can't handle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/62b5b3056dbc585299cb4d9b6ce13e70.apng?t=1758094031\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/62b5b3056dbc585299cb4d9b6ce13e70.poster.avif?t=1758094031\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=56 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/1c5aa1c0612d023aeecc04dcfb4d9fe7.poster.avif?t=1758094031\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/1c5aa1c0612d023aeecc04dcfb4d9fe7.webm?t=1758094031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/1c5aa1c0612d023aeecc04dcfb4d9fe7.mp4?t=1758094031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While serving customers and managing your boba tea shop, you start seeing visions and hearing things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it all in your head, or is something haunting the place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is\u00a0psychological horror game that builds tension through eerie atmosphere, unsettling events, and moments of intense scare when you least expect them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> A simple yet engaging loop where you take orders from customers, prepare their drinks, and serve them with a smile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS Aesthetics:</strong> Experience the game through a creepy VHS filter that adds a nostalgic and eerie atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong> Uncover Risa's journey and personal growth as she pursues her dream of becoming a successful boba tea shop owner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >For content creators:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to create content from the game and monetize the gameplay by any means. There are no other restrictions from my side when playing the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Boba is love","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3461920/b0b9a9dba9714058cfe7c38e8b15ab8c79b80f46.jpg"},{"name":"Spotless","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3461920/2fcd9a2a13950c1c52b5a07b1ea18a89e2ecd218.jpg"},{"name":"Brewing Profits","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3461920/b9b11a3137f52ee5f69f9152fe192534350c897d.jpg"},{"name":"Trash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3461920/6f0293e873af9e90132c2476c5d7228a99a935fb.jpg"},{"name":"All That Glitters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3461920/c8c46037e959a78bc7acf8831dbdeb1c234b9210.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3461920?t=1758094031","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/6a79d6c2d2b20bf10c0ad0476045c22ef40bc1cd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758094031","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/a3fc834a74555893082464e092db52d6802eab76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758094031","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/a3fc834a74555893082464e092db52d6802eab76/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758094031","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains themes and imagery that may not be suitable for all audiences. It includes:\r\n-Depictions of suicide\r\n-Stylized representations of blood and unsettling scenes\r\n\r\nSome story elements explore psychological distress and mental health struggles that may be disturbing to sensitive players."},"demos":[{"appid":3521210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Boba Teashop</strong> is a cozy horror game where you own and manage a boba tea shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare boba teas, serve customers, and expand your menu to attract more patrons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/6c59aac69b7e37e9a2d03f9951c2f697.webp?t=1758094031\" width=600 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/4615eb958d8b4b4c46634730fc3178db.poster.avif?t=1758094031\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/4615eb958d8b4b4c46634730fc3178db.webm?t=1758094031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/4615eb958d8b4b4c46634730fc3178db.mp4?t=1758094031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Risa, a woman in her 30s who is tired of corporate life and has decided to chase her dream of opening a boba tea shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/3f685c11d3eddb2a0e8dc64bcdf16c3b.webp?t=1758094031\" width=600 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/eadb667dc9800e443351e12f717d40d0.poster.avif?t=1758094031\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/eadb667dc9800e443351e12f717d40d0.webm?t=1758094031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/eadb667dc9800e443351e12f717d40d0.mp4?t=1758094031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a boba tea shop owner, you will encounter a variety of customers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to greet them with a smile and take their orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/682abfa4b58a538318ce9c479acd2107.webp?t=1758094031\" width=600 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/0980534b3249f455a025db49a50d5400.poster.avif?t=1758094031\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/0980534b3249f455a025db49a50d5400.webm?t=1758094031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/0980534b3249f455a025db49a50d5400.mp4?t=1758094031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making boba tea is simple.\u00a0The ingredients are just milk tea and boba.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seal the cup with a lid and serve it with a straw for sipping and enjoying the boba pearls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/69e7b219a726ab7af3fa0528aafcc7c3.poster.avif?t=1758094031\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/69e7b219a726ab7af3fa0528aafcc7c3.webm?t=1758094031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/69e7b219a726ab7af3fa0528aafcc7c3.mp4?t=1758094031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But sometimes, you'll encounter demanding customers with special requests or those who leave a mess in your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the proud owner of a boba tea shop, there's nothing you can't handle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/62b5b3056dbc585299cb4d9b6ce13e70.apng?t=1758094031\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/62b5b3056dbc585299cb4d9b6ce13e70.poster.avif?t=1758094031\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=56 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/1c5aa1c0612d023aeecc04dcfb4d9fe7.poster.avif?t=1758094031\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/1c5aa1c0612d023aeecc04dcfb4d9fe7.webm?t=1758094031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/extras/1c5aa1c0612d023aeecc04dcfb4d9fe7.mp4?t=1758094031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While serving customers and managing your boba tea shop, you start seeing visions and hearing things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it all in your head, or is something haunting the place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is\u00a0psychological horror game that builds tension through eerie atmosphere, unsettling events, and moments of intense scare when you least expect them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> A simple yet engaging loop where you take orders from customers, prepare their drinks, and serve them with a smile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS Aesthetics:</strong> Experience the game through a creepy VHS filter that adds a nostalgic and eerie atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong> Uncover Risa's journey and personal growth as she pursues her dream of becoming a successful boba tea shop owner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >For content creators:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to create content from the game and monetize the gameplay by any means. There are no other restrictions from my side when playing the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Mike Ten"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461920/header.jpg?t=1758094031","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3461920/872920/838ef39ddfa930b8a35f5b3e2afdbd311752db44/1750826161/dash_av1.mpd?t=1744979409","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3461920/872920/838ef39ddfa930b8a35f5b3e2afdbd311752db44/1750826161/dash_h264.mpd?t=1744979409","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3461920/872920/838ef39ddfa930b8a35f5b3e2afdbd311752db44/1750826161/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1744979409","id":257127710,"name":"Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257127710/68a11d50e06030dec49b42db080ad6cb9b3b94f0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744979409"}],"name":"The Boba Teashop","package_groups":[{"descrip